 keel (>= 0.12.0),
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: Keel overlay: the installer
 The installer overlay of Keel Linux (handbook decision 0036): Keel's
 inithooks, confconsole and keel, which install an appliance in a simple
 or a cloud mode and emit its instance spec, and the overlay manifest keel
 reads, installed as /usr/share/keel/overlays/installer.yaml (decision
 0041).
 .
 The manifest names the first boot hooks the three packages ship. The
 overlay declares no process: it is enabled in every installation mode.
